# The top app bar's four slots, in the order a hand reaches them.
#
#   the section list   a root: a title and nothing else
#   Display            the leading arrow arrives, because B now leaves
#   one edit           the trailing badge arrives, and the arrow leaves with it - B is
#                      discard while edits are pending, and the bar says only what B does
#   Modules > MQTT     the overline: the one level between the tab and this screen. "Settings"
#                      is not in it, because the navigation bar is already saying that
scene demo
scale 4
delay 260
config

tab settings
hold 700
key down 4
key a
hold 900
key right
hold 1200
key b
key b
hold 500
key down 7
key a
hold 800
key a
hold 1200
key b
hold 600
